{"v":1,"id":"3fbab5160c85","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"When I needed comfort, I ran to you","s":8.34,"e":16.44},{"t":"Heard my troubled cry, pulled me safely through","s":18.66,"e":25.92},{"t":"But as peace returned and struggle drifted by","s":27.96,"e":35.2},{"t":"My restless heart let distance grow with time","s":38.06,"e":45.38},{"t":"Let me not break your heart","s":45.38,"e":49.82},{"t":"Teach me how to stay","s":50.32,"e":54.62},{"t":"Not just to call on you when storms roll in","s":56.64,"e":63.02},{"t":"But to dwell and abide in your love each day","s":63.02,"e":68.76},{"t":"I've tasted grace in desperate hands","s":76.22,"e":83.38},{"t":"Betrayed in presence for hollow plans","s":86.82,"e":93.52},{"t":"Satisfied by comfort, I ran from your will","s":96.72,"e":103.36},{"t":"Now the longing for you, it's haunting me still","s":105.36,"e":112.94},{"t":"So I come undone and needy","s":115.16,"e":120.3},{"t":"With no pretense, no pride","s":120.3,"e":124.62},{"t":"Take this heart and make it ready","s":125.24,"e":129.72},{"t":"Hurts my soul from all I hide","s":129.72,"e":134.08},{"t":"Let me not break your heart","s":135.46,"e":139.3},{"t":"Teach me how to stay","s":140.74,"e":143.94},{"t":"Not just to call on you when storms roll in","s":146.28,"e":152.38},{"t":"But to dwell and abide in your love each day","s":152.38,"e":158.16},{"t":"Prepare me a dwelling place","s":160.48,"e":163.86},{"t":"Body, mind and spirit made new","s":164.42,"e":168.5},{"t":"Cleanse these chambers","s":171.02,"e":173.16},{"t":"Sweep away what should not stay","s":173.16,"e":178.22},{"t":"Let devotion rise with every breath","s":180.58,"e":184.86},{"t":"Let obedience shine in all I do","s":184.86,"e":190.12},{"t":"And worship be my dwelling","s":190.12,"e":193.7},{"t":"Sharing in your cup anew","s":193.7,"e":198.34},{"t":"You are the mercy","s":198.34,"e":202.9},{"t":"My spirit has known","s":202.9,"e":207.24},{"t":"Even as I've wandered","s":210.0,"e":213.46},{"t":"Called comfort home","s":213.46,"e":217.06},{"t":"Let need become a song","s":219.72,"e":223.46},{"t":"Let longing never cease","s":223.46,"e":227.06},{"t":"Until radical praise and surrender","s":229.4,"e":233.54},{"t":"Bring your heart peace","s":233.54,"e":236.88},{"t":"Let me not break your heart","s":237.78,"e":241.22},{"t":"Teach me how to stay","s":242.48,"e":245.82},{"t":"Not just to call on you","s":248.1,"e":251.84},{"t":"When storms roll in","s":251.84,"e":254.32},{"t":"But to dwell and abide in your love","s":254.32,"e":257.94},{"t":"Each day","s":258.64,"e":260.02},{"t":"With every melody","s":266.36,"e":270.28},{"t":"Surrendered","s":270.28,"e":272.88},{"t":"Every thought made true","s":272.88,"e":276.36},{"t":"I will press in","s":276.36,"e":280.24},{"t":"Lord, preparing room","s":280.24,"e":284.76},{"t":"For your spirit to fill","s":286.88,"e":290.52},{"t":"For your love","s":292.22,"e":294.7},{"t":"To renew","s":296.92,"e":299.52}],"match":null}
